<title>USA: Freddie Mac to redeem debenture issues.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac to redeem debenture issues.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp said Wednesday that on December 12 it will redeem $75 million in two debenture issues as follows.</p>
<p>  Principal  Interest   Maturity     Cusip</p>
<p> $50 million   7.584    03/27/06   3134A0YW6</p>
<p> $25 million   7.65     03/27/06   3134A0YS5</p>
<p>Freddie Mac said it will redeem the issues in their entirety at a price equal to 100 percent of principal. It will pay principal plus accrued interest to the redemption date to holders of record as of the close of business on December 11.</p>
</text>
